## 6. Technical Feasibility Check

* **Background Location:** Accessing location at the exact time of `SMS_RECEIVED` requires `ACCESS_BACKGROUND_LOCATION` permission. This is heavily restricted on the Google Play Store. 
  * *Alternative:* We can fall back to the last-known coarse location to avoid requesting high-risk background location permissions.
* **Notification Input:** Yes, Expo / React Native supports Android notification actions with text input fields using libraries like `notifee` or custom Expo modules.
* **Local Processing:** Storing the pending items in SQLite or AsyncStorage and sync-scheduling via React Native `WorkManager` or custom Expo tasks is fully supported.
